1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 26=

15
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:04,800
(Auspicious Omens)

16
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,350
How is that brat still alive?

17
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:09,200
Impossible.

18
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,310
He took a fatal blow from Wang Feng,

19
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:13,480
a Greater Perfection Realm cultivator.

20
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:16,120
Sword qi pierced his body.

21
00:01:16,230 --> 00:01:17,120
Could it be...

22
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,560
He used the Sect Master's sword qi

23
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,510
to break through.

24
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,510
I see.

25
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:22,680
He provoked us so brazenly

26
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,790
just to find a chance to break through.

27
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:26,560
We can't let him break through.

28
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:27,840
If he breaks through,

29
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:29,230
with his talent,

30
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,790
we won't be able to stop him.

31
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:31,950
Attack together!

32
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:38,190
♪I climb the mountains on my own♪
(Fire, Fragrance)

33
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,190
♪I fear no rugged road♪

34
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,910
♪With every punch and kick,
I carve out a brighter path♪

35
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,870
♪I climb toward the clouds on my own♪

36
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,260
♪Why should I need anyone's pity♪

37
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,310
♪With courage in my heart♪

38
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,150
I finally broke through.

39
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:05,760
What now?

40
00:02:06,510 --> 00:02:08,080
Those two can no longer fight.

41
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,310
Can we defeat him?

42
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:11,520
They were only at Stages 4 and 5
of the Minor Perfection Realm.

43
00:02:11,910 --> 00:02:12,630
They hardly mattered.

44
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,800
We're both at Stage 9
of the Minor Perfection Realm

45
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,710
and have been at this stage for years.

46
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,430
He just reached
the Greater Perfection Realm,

47
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:20,960
and his realm is unstable.

48
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,150
We still have a chance.

49
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:25,400
We must strike together and fast.

50
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,630
♪I climb the mountains on my own♪

51
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,590
♪I fear no rugged road♪

52
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,560
♪With every punch and kick,
I carve out a brighter path♪

53
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,710
♪I climb toward the clouds on my own♪
(Lingering Fragrance)

54
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:39,470
♪Why should I need anyone's pity♪

55
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,700
♪With courage in my heart♪

56
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:44,840
Spiritual energy from Stage 9
of the Minor Perfection Realm.

57
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,630
Not bad at all.

58
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:49,400
Things are about to change
in the Southern Domain.

59
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,190
Spare me, Sect Master.

60
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:53,080
I'll join Solitude Sect.

61
00:02:53,430 --> 00:02:55,240
I belong to your sect now.

62
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,750
I never wanted to kill you.

63
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,360
But you kept trying to kill me.

64
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,840
After all that,

65
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,190
do you really think I'd let you live?

66
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:05,520
Why?

67
00:03:06,190 --> 00:03:08,000
We've cultivated for centuries.

68
00:03:08,150 --> 00:03:09,280
Why are we still no match for you?

69
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,590
Even if you reached
the Greater Perfection Realm,

70
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:13,710
why can't we last even one move

71
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,470
against you?

72
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:17,080
If I'd only just entered
the Greater Perfection Realm,

73
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,400
sure.

74
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:21,710
But what if I'm at Stage 9?

75
00:03:24,380 --> 00:03:25,620
(Greater Perfection Realm, Stage 9)

76
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,560
Impossible.

77
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:35,590
I've stored enough
spiritual energy inside me.

78
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,080
So after breaking through,

79
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,910
my cultivation soared.

80
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:40,560
If not for the realm bottleneck,

81
00:03:40,710 --> 00:03:42,590
I might've advanced straight toward

82
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,000
the Immortal Realm.

83
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:46,360
I see.

84
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:05,400
For the sake of our old ties,

85
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,680
I'll give you a choice today.

86
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,520
Die,

87
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,910
or submit.

88
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,120
Greetings, Sect Master.

89
00:04:42,830 --> 00:04:43,830
The three Sect Masters

90
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,510
and our three elders

91
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:46,830
went to handle Zhao Feiyang.

92
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,190
Why is it taking so long?

93
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,430
Yes, far too long.

94
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,480
Did something happen?

95
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,040
Lan.

96
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,720
Send a voice transmission to
Sect Master Qin.

97
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:55,270
I already did,

98
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,800
but there was no response.

99
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:57,950
How is that possible?

100
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,190
Should we also go take a look?

101
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:00,750
Yes.

102
00:05:02,750 --> 00:05:03,390
They're back.

103
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,480
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
What?

104
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,830
Why is Zhao Feiyang still alive?

105
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,430
What happened?

106
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,070
Sect Master Wang.

107
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,120
Where are the Sect Masters

108
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,430
of Qingyun and Tianwu?

109
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,680
They...

110
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:19,480
died in battle.

111
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:20,950
How is this possible?

112
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:22,480
What exactly happened?

113
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,310
From this day on,

114
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:26,120
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
in Shenwu Continent's Southern Domain,

115
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,630
all Heavenly Sword,

116
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:30,950
Tianwu, and Qingyun Sect disciples

117
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,040
will join Solitude Sect.

118
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,720
Zhao Feiyang, how dare you?

119
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,430
Our Sect Master and elders are here.

120
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,920
Yet you still talk big?

121
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:39,630
Sect Master.

122
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:41,120
Elder Deng, Elder Murong.

123
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:42,160
Why are you still standing there

124
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:43,680
letting Zhao Feiyang spout nonsense?

125
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:44,750
Seize him.

126
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:55,870
Those who follow me will prosper.

127
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,510
Those who oppose me will perish.

128
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,680
Anyone who objects today

129
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,000
will share the fate

130
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,360
of the Tianwu and Qingyun Sect Masters.

131
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:05,360
So it was you
who killed our Sect Master!

132
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,360
I'll fight you to the death!

133
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,430
Wake up.

134
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:08,630
Wu.

135
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,120
Can't you see the faces

136
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:12,160
of Heavenly Sword Sect's three leaders?

137
00:06:12,950 --> 00:06:13,480
The Southern Domain

138
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,070
has already changed hands.

139
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,830
Why throw our lives away?

140
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,070
Wu.

141
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,040
Wu.

142
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,310
Are you all right, Wu?

143
00:06:29,870 --> 00:06:31,720
Just one glance was that powerful.

144
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,390
Just how strong is he?

145
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,510
If anyone has any objections,

146
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,040
step forward now.

147
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,040
Zhao Feiyang.

148
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:47,680
No, no.

149
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:48,630
Sect Master.

150
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,120
I offended you before.

151
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,920
Please forgive me.

152
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,190
Please be magnanimous

153
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,560
and let me go.

154
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,560
What's gotten into all of you?

155
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,160
Greetings, Sect Master.

156
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,040
Greetings, Sect Master.

157
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,000
Greetings, Sect Master.

158
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,160
Greetings, Sect Master.

159
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:21,240
Greetings, Sect Master.

160
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,720
Greetings, Sect Master.

161
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:26,430
Greetings, Sect Master.

162
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,600
(Solitude Sect)
Sect Master.

163
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,750
What will you do next?

164
00:07:31,070 --> 00:07:32,600
The Southern Domain
lacks spiritual energy.

165
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,240
Our sect cannot grow here.

166
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:36,310
And I have a personal vendetta.

167
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,870
So my target is the Western Domain.

168
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:40,920
Do you plan to raise an army
and march into the Western Domain?

169
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:43,310
You're a half-step Earth Immortal,

170
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:44,600
but the Lord of Nether Hall

171
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,040
is a true Earth Immortal.

172
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:48,510
He commands countless experts.

173
00:07:48,830 --> 00:07:50,390
Should we await destruction,

174
00:07:50,630 --> 00:07:53,510
or secure a better future
for Southern Domain cultivators?

175
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,800
Nether Hall.

176
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,190
I'll go alone.

177
00:07:59,390 --> 00:07:59,950
What?

178
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:02,270
After all, it is my personal vendetta.

179
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,240
Bring together the rogue cultivators
of the Southern Domain

180
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,160
and stockpile every resource.

181
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,680
This world

182
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:10,120
will soon face

183
00:08:10,270 --> 00:08:11,830
a calamity targeting cultivators.

184
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:13,360
You mean the great tribulation?

185
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:18,270
Sect Master.

186
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:20,310
Tianxuan Kingdom is attacking
Nanyuan Kingdom.

187
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:23,000
Now nanyuan's ruler seeks our aid.

188
00:08:23,430 --> 00:08:24,270
If we win,

189
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,870
Nanyuan Kingdom will become our vassal.

190
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:27,190
All its cultivation resources

191
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:28,680
will fall under our control.

192
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,000
The Southern Domain's two kingdoms

193
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:31,680
have long wanted to annex each other.

194
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,720
Now Tianxuan Kingdom

195
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,440
has finally made its move.

196
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:38,120
This works in our favor.

197
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:41,000
We'll help Nanyuan Kingdom
defeat Tianxuan Kingdom.

198
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:41,790
Then

199
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,000
both kingdoms' resources

200
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,200
will belong to Solitude Sect.

201
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:45,960
That way,

202
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:47,600
consolidating the Southern Domain's
cultivation resources

203
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,200
will be far easier.

204
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,320
Take our forces and leave first.

205
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:53,840
I'll follow shortly.

206
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:57,480
Yes, Sect Master.

207
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:15,150
(What exactly do you want me to do?)

208
00:09:29,820 --> 00:09:33,610
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

209
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:36,010
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

210
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:40,130
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

211
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:44,690
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

212
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:48,010
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

213
00:09:48,850 --> 00:09:51,520
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

214
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:55,140
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

215
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:58,950
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

216
00:09:59,820 --> 00:10:02,990
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

217
00:10:03,260 --> 00:10:06,380
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

218
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:09,700
♪With this flesh and soul♪

219
00:10:10,020 --> 00:10:13,250
♪I shall forge a new age♪

220
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:16,330
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

221
00:10:16,700 --> 00:10:19,790
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

222
00:10:20,010 --> 00:10:22,650
♪At cultivation's peak♪

223
00:10:22,660 --> 00:10:26,010
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

224
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:29,490
♪The sun and moon turn♪

225
00:10:29,490 --> 00:10:33,010
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

226
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:39,990
♪I am the undying flame♪

227
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:45,650
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

228
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:49,010
♪At last I see, immortality♪

229
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:54,150
♪Lives in your smiles♪
